{"id":404903101,"chapter_id":50092,"scene_id":59214,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"【办公室】","style":18,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"问讯处的日常总是很吵。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"来报案的、来登记的、来哭诉财物丢失的、来投诉街区噪音扰民的人总是络绎不绝。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"墨菲坐在靠里侧的位置。那是个不算显眼的工位，桌脚永远有点不稳，抽屉拉到一半会卡住，天花板的灯偶尔还会在她头顶闪两下。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"很适合她——至少同事们都是这么觉得的。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"同事","content":"墨菲，你先别碰那台终端。上次你一碰，它直接蓝屏了半小时。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_08"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"同事","content":"还有饮水机……昨天她刚把出水口的开关按坏。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_09"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"同事","content":"不是吧，这也能坏？","voice":["vo_event_404903101_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"同事","content":"她是墨菲诶。你以为墨菲这名字是白叫的？","voice":["vo_event_404903101_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"这些话她早就听习惯了。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"大多数时候，大家也不是真的讨厌她。只是在她捅了太多篓子之后，谁都会下意识绕开她。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"墨菲低下头，把刚泡好的速溶咖啡往自己这边拽了两下。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"下一秒，纸杯底部就很不给面子地裂开一道缝，滚烫的咖啡从桌面哗啦一下流到地上。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……对不起。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"同事","content":"你看，我就说吧。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"同事","content":"没事没事，抹布在那边，你别急——哎，别站起来，地上滑！","voice":["vo_event_404903101_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"啪。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"话音未落，墨菲已经一脚踩在咖啡上，连人带椅子狼狈地往后摔去。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"办公室里安静了一瞬，接着有人憋笑，有人叹气，也有人已经习惯到懒得发表意见。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"只有靠近窗口的那个同事站了起来。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"行了，她又不是故意的。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"她走过来，把墨菲从地上拉起来，顺手把自己桌上的纸巾盒塞给墨菲。她的动作很自然，像这种事已经做过很多次了。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"膝盖磕到了没？","voice":["vo_event_404903101_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……没有。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"那就好。下次杯子别倒那么满。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……对不起。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"你看，你又来了。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"我又没在怪你。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"墨菲抬起头，小心翼翼地看了面前的人一眼。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"content":"琪琪是问讯处里少数还愿意主动和她说话的人。她也不是同情墨菲，她就是单纯地觉得：倒霉归倒霉，人不坏就行。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"久而久之，她们会一起值班，一起吃便利店打折便当，一起在夜班时对着永远处理不完的表格发呆。","style":3,"background":2217,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"在和琪琪相处的日子里，墨菲开朗了许多。琪琪甚至给墨菲买了个四叶草项链，说是希望她能运气好起来。","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"这已经很像朋友了。至少对墨菲来说，是的。","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"就在一个再普通不过的午后，新城外围突发禁闭者暴动，弄了很大的动静。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"通讯频道里充斥着重叠的指令、调度和不断更新的伤亡通报，值班大厅的电子屏一块接一块地亮了起来。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"警报","content":"紧急调令发布。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":11,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"speaker":"警报","content":"局内所有具备行动能力的工作人员立即前往集结点待命。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":11,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……所有人？连我们都要去吗？","voice":["vo_event_404903101_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"你要追查的嫌疑人R，就躲在广场西侧的彼岸诊所——那正是辛迪加有名的禁闭者势力。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"完了，我连包扎课都只上过两次。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"content":"她嘴上这么说，手却已经在飞快整理物资箱了。纱布、止血带、便携注射器……","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"content":"墨菲站在原地不知所措。她是问讯处的，琪琪也是。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"content":"平时最多登记和整理资料，说穿了也就是个客服，现在却要跟着整局的人一起进入狂厄现场。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"content":"……怎么会有这么倒霉的事。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":46,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"别发呆，帮我拿那个白箱。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……哦，好。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"你害怕吗？","voice":["vo_event_404903101_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……嗯。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":50,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"我也是。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":51,"content":"但两个人谁都没有抱怨。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1},{"step":52,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":53,"content":"烟、火、警笛、四处奔逃的人群，还有远处狂厄翻涌出的不祥波动，把整片街区都搅得乱七八糟。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":54,"content":"墨菲的脑中只来得及重复一句话——先止血，再包扎。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":55,"content":"先止血，再包扎。可做起来和说起来并不是一样的难度。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":56,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"别、别动……这里先按住。","voice":["vo_event_404903101_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":57,"speaker":"伤员","content":"嘶——","voice":["vo_event_404903101_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":58,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"对不起……不是，我是说，再忍一下，马上就好……","voice":["vo_event_404903101_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":59,"content":"琪琪就在她身侧不远，正和另外两名同事一起把受伤群众往临时警戒线后面带。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":60,"content":"所有人都只是硬着头皮，把平时学过的零碎知识和本能一起扔进去，盼着不要再出现新的状况。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":61,"content":"可天总是不遂人愿。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":62,"content":"不远处一辆侧翻的运载车车门突然松动，半截车门就那么直直地砸了下来。而那车门的下方正是琪琪。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":63,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"琪琪！","voice":["vo_event_404903101_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":64,"content":"墨菲不顾一切地冲过去，金属门板轰然砸地，边缘狠狠擦过琪琪的侧肩和背，带出一道当场见血的口子。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":65,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"咳……我没事，先把箱子拿起来……","voice":["vo_event_404903101_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":66,"content":"纱布掉在地上，卡扣怎么都扣不进止血带，墨菲眼前的血像怎么堵都堵不住一样，不断往外渗。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":67,"content":"她第一次这么害怕。害怕生命的逝去，更害怕自己的朋友消失。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":68,"content":"再后来，增援赶到，狂厄爆发现场也在更高等级禁闭者介入后暂时稳定。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":69,"content":"经过治疗，重伤的琪琪活了下来，但墨菲却成为了禁闭者。","style":3,"background":2320,"log_type":1},{"step":70,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":71,"content":"琪琪的伤养了两个月，留了疤，但不影响行动。治安局里不少人都说这是不幸中的万幸。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":72,"content":"可墨菲知道，其实这一切都是自己的错。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":73,"content":"那天晚班结束后，办公室里只剩她们两个人。墨菲抱着文件站了很久，终于还是琪琪先开了口。","style":3,"background":2221117,"log_type":1},{"step":74,"speaker":"琪琪","content":"我知道那次不是你的错——","voice":["vo_event_404903101_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2221117,"log_type":1},{"step":75,"content":"可墨菲摇了摇头，打断了对方的话。","style":3,"background":2221117,"log_type":1},{"step":76,"content":"紧接着，她把琪琪送给她的四叶草项链摘了下来，放回到琪琪手中。","style":3,"background":2221117,"log_type":1},{"step":77,"content":"对于墨菲来说，这是她唯一能够保护朋友的方式了。","style":3,"background":2221117,"log_type":1},{"step":78,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":79,"content":"昏黄的旧灯骤然熄灭。","style":3,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":80,"content":"检修灯重新亮起时，你仍站在管理局下层那条走廊上。","style":3,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":81,"content":"前方是更深处尚未散尽的黑雾。而一道踉跄的脚印，正一直往黑暗最深处延伸。","style":3,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":82,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"……刚刚那是？","voice":["vo_event_404903101_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":83,"speaker":"琳","content":"像、像是墨菲小姐的记忆……","voice":["vo_event_404903101_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49031","style":1,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":84,"content":"是狂厄，它把一切的负面情绪都散发出来了。","style":2,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":85,"content":"随着管理局的复原，狂厄同时也随之显露。","style":3,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":86,"content":"说着他指指远处，一些使徒的幻影正在徘徊，似乎失去了BR-005的呼唤，它们陷入了迷茫，只能循着残留的痕迹游荡。","style":3,"background":2592117,"log_type":1},{"step":87,"speaker":"局长","content":"走，追上去！","style":2,"background":2592117,"log_type":1}]}